<title>GABON: SOCCER-GABON BEAT KENYA 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GABON BEAT KENYA 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LIBREVILLE 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gabon beat Kenya 1-0 (0-0) on Sunday in their group five African Nations Cup qualifier.</p>
<p>Scorer: Theodore Nzue Nguema 50</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
